WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:01.470
- Don't dare move a muscle,

00:00:01.470 --> 00:00:05.410
just this afternoon I
had an extra $200,000.

00:00:05.410 --> 00:00:09.203
I gave it to the two best hit
men west of the Mississippi.

00:00:16.470 --> 00:00:17.370
- Oh, yeah, right.

00:00:27.021 --> 00:00:29.850
- You know, I don't exactly
know how to feel about all this.

00:00:29.850 --> 00:00:31.430
- For real, yo.

00:00:31.430 --> 00:00:33.320
While thing felt kinda shady, you know,

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.430
like morality wise?

00:00:35.430 --> 00:00:36.380
- [Badger] Totally.

00:00:39.118 --> 00:00:40.218
- How do you feel now?

00:00:42.870 --> 00:00:43.910
- Better.

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:45.950
- Yeah, definitely improving.

00:00:45.950 --> 00:00:48.300
- What do you think all
those sparkles and shit are?

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:50.430
Transporters are breaking you apart, man,

00:00:50.430 --> 00:00:52.460
down to your molecules and bones,

00:00:52.460 --> 00:00:54.000
they're makin' a copy.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:55.620
That dude who comes out on the other side?

00:00:55.620 --> 00:00:58.520
He's not you, he's a color Xerox.

00:00:58.520 --> 00:00:59.353
- So you're telling me

00:00:59.353 --> 00:01:01.230
every time Kirk went into the Transporter,

00:01:01.230 --> 00:01:02.590
he was killing himself?

00:01:02.590 --> 00:01:04.530
- Dude, yo, why do you think McCoy

00:01:04.530 --> 00:01:06.460
never likes to beam nowhere?

00:01:06.460 --> 00:01:08.400
'Cause he's a doctor, bitch.

00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:10.130
Look it up, it's science.

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:13.130
- I ever tell you about
my "Star Trek" script?

00:01:13.130 --> 00:01:18.130
The Enterprise is five
parsecs out of Rigel XII.

00:01:18.760 --> 00:01:21.460
Nothing's goin' on, neutral zone is quiet,

00:01:21.460 --> 00:01:25.420
the crew is bored, so they
put on a pie-eating contest.

00:01:25.420 --> 00:01:27.203
They're eating blueberry pies--

00:01:27.203 --> 00:01:28.036
- [Skinny Pete] Better.

00:01:28.036 --> 00:01:31.279
- As fast at the replicator
can churn them out.

00:01:31.279 --> 00:01:33.040
(imitates machine beeping)

00:01:33.040 --> 00:01:35.440
Okay, Spock always wins these things.

00:01:35.440 --> 00:01:37.630
- How is Spock gonna been Kirk, yo?

00:01:37.630 --> 00:01:38.960
Spock's like a toothbrush,

00:01:38.960 --> 00:01:40.710
look at Kirk, he's got room to spare.

00:01:40.710 --> 00:01:44.340
- Spock has total Vulcan
control over his digestion.

00:01:44.340 --> 00:01:45.970
You wanna hear this or not?

00:01:45.970 --> 00:01:46.803
- [Skinny Pete] Yeah, yeah, go.

00:01:46.803 --> 00:01:48.380
- Okay, but Chekov, you see,

00:01:48.380 --> 00:01:52.640
he's got whole fat stack
of quatloos riding on this

00:01:52.640 --> 00:01:55.470
and he has figured out a way to win.

00:01:55.470 --> 00:01:57.830
He's got Scotty back
in the Transporter Room

00:01:57.830 --> 00:01:59.790
locked in on Chekov's stomach.

00:01:59.790 --> 00:02:01.530
Every time Chekov eats a pie,

00:02:01.530 --> 00:02:03.070
Scotty beams it right out of him.

00:02:03.070 --> 00:02:04.560
- Where's he sending them, the toilet?

00:02:04.560 --> 00:02:06.230
- Space!
- Oh!

00:02:06.230 --> 00:02:08.760
- There's blueberries
just floating out there,

00:02:08.760 --> 00:02:11.410
Scotty's in the Transporter
Room fiddling with the levers

00:02:11.410 --> 00:02:13.600
when Lieutenant Uhura comes in

00:02:13.600 --> 00:02:16.120
and she's got, you know, her big pointies

00:02:16.120 --> 00:02:18.755
and Scotty's fingers are all sweaty.

00:02:18.755 --> 00:02:19.588
- No!

00:02:19.588 --> 00:02:20.640
- Chekov screams,

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:23.460
he sprays blood out of his mouth,

00:02:23.460 --> 00:02:26.210
Scotty beamed his guts into space!

00:02:26.210 --> 00:02:27.263
- No way!

00:02:29.880 --> 00:02:30.910
- Hey man, where are you goin'?

00:02:30.910 --> 00:02:32.470
You're missin' the best part.

00:02:32.470 --> 00:02:34.070
- What's the point of bein' an outlaw

00:02:34.070 --> 00:02:35.570
when you got responsibilities?

00:02:37.670 --> 00:02:40.110
- Darth Vader had responsibilities.

00:02:40.110 --> 00:02:41.910
He was responsible for the Death Star.

00:02:41.910 --> 00:02:43.867
- True that, two of them bitches.

00:02:45.041 --> 00:02:45.874
- So, how's it sellin'?

00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:50.070
- I sold a teenth.

00:02:50.070 --> 00:02:51.740
- One teenth?

00:02:51.740 --> 00:02:53.242
That's it?

00:02:53.242 --> 00:02:54.649
- [Badger] Yeah.

00:02:54.649 --> 00:02:56.190
- To who?

00:02:56.190 --> 00:02:57.023
- Him.

00:03:01.258 --> 00:03:04.081
I could so use a brain
transplant right now.

00:03:04.081 --> 00:03:05.302
Wake up, bitch!

00:03:05.302 --> 00:03:06.530
(Skinny Pete screams)

00:03:06.530 --> 00:03:11.030
(performing classical music on piano)

00:03:13.086 --> 00:03:16.253
(strums guitar badly)

00:03:21.120 --> 00:03:22.640
We sound great!

00:03:22.640 --> 00:03:24.500
- Check out that crystal size, yo.

00:03:24.500 --> 00:03:27.280
If that bitch was any bigger
it'd be a Jolly Rancher!

00:03:27.280 --> 00:03:28.683
- Be my guest.

00:03:31.066 --> 00:03:33.899
(Badger exclaims)

00:03:37.861 --> 00:03:38.730
- Woo!

00:03:38.730 --> 00:03:40.020
River dance!

00:03:40.020 --> 00:03:44.163
- Hey, hey, stop markin' up
my floor dumb ass, come on.

00:03:47.900 --> 00:03:49.578
- Bow before me.

00:03:49.578 --> 00:03:51.003
- Wow.

00:03:51.003 --> 00:03:52.253
- I am Lord of the Dance.

00:03:56.720 --> 00:03:57.930
- Left 4 Dead, yo.

00:03:57.930 --> 00:03:59.330
The way them bitches get all cranial

00:03:59.330 --> 00:04:00.230
when you cap them in the head,

00:04:00.230 --> 00:04:01.443
it's like, booyah!

00:04:02.460 --> 00:04:06.390
- Okay, Call of Duty:
World at War, zombie mode,

00:04:06.390 --> 00:04:08.610
now that's the bomb, man.

00:04:08.610 --> 00:04:09.570
Think on it, bro,

00:04:09.570 --> 00:04:11.230
they're not just zombies,

00:04:11.230 --> 00:04:12.890
they're Nazi zombies.

00:04:12.890 --> 00:04:13.723
- What difference does it make

00:04:13.723 --> 00:04:15.180
what their job was when they was livin'?

00:04:15.180 --> 00:04:17.650
- Dude, you are so historically retarted.

00:04:17.650 --> 00:04:20.170
Nazi zombies don't wanna eat you

00:04:20.170 --> 00:04:22.340
just 'cause they're craving protein.

00:04:22.340 --> 00:04:23.850
They do it 'cause,

00:04:23.850 --> 00:04:27.680
they do it 'cause they
hate Americans, man.

00:04:27.680 --> 00:04:28.720
- I played the game bro,

00:04:28.720 --> 00:04:30.830
they aint exactly fleet of foot.

00:04:30.830 --> 00:04:33.020
I'm sayin' where's the challenge?

00:04:33.020 --> 00:04:34.840
At least the zombies in Left 4 Dead

00:04:34.840 --> 00:04:36.050
clock a respectable 40,

00:04:36.050 --> 00:04:37.330
you gotta lead 'em and shit.

00:04:37.330 --> 00:04:38.373
- Dude, that's 'cause
they're not even zombies,

00:04:38.373 --> 00:04:40.500
they're just infected.

00:04:40.500 --> 00:04:42.510
They got like this rage virus,

00:04:42.510 --> 00:04:45.580
amps 'em up they been smokin' the schwag.

00:04:45.580 --> 00:04:47.280
Totally unfair to compare the two.

00:04:48.139 --> 00:04:51.056
(hoover passes by)

00:04:53.725 --> 00:04:55.475
Did that just happen?

